PUTTAPE NUMBER,MACRONAME,[SOME DESCRIPTIVE MESSAGE]

PUTTAPE 2,SHIRLEY,[SHIRLEY DRAWS PINK ELEPHANT HATS]

GETTAPE SHIRLEY

DSETUP 0
DUSEMAP

DSETUP 1
DINIT 200

DS 1
SAM=NB
DPUT SAM,[SAM IS A COPY OF NB]
DUSEMAP

DGET SAM
USEMAP

DCREATE SUBMAPNAME,[MESSAGE]

DCREATE PAINT,[PAINT PROGRAM SUBMAP]
DUSEMAP

DSETUP n

DSETUP n,PAINT
